0 A tall workshop lamp has a dish-shaped shade on a side arm and a cable spiralling down its mast.
0 Name: ELECTRIC_CABLE-Constraints.ldr
0 Author: Steffen [Steffen]
0 Unofficial Model
0 // Scene: A small layered foot supports a slender lattice mast. The lamp hangs to one side near the top, while a blue lead follows the mast down toward its base.
0 // Rigid construction: A train signal stand and mast supply the upright. An axle, bushes and a pin/bush connector carry the dish and electric lightbrick; the electric plug is a separate end fitting.
0 // Build lesson: Reuse dedicated mast, lamp and connector parts to make a slim service fixture with a clear base, support arm, shade and power route.
0 // Reuse: Recheck the side-arm support and plug seating in a new model; the transparent display palette is not a statement of available colours.
